              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The Regalia Resplendent provides a 2+ Armour Save and a 4+ Invulnerable Save, and allows any failed Invulnerable Saves made on a turn in which Sanguinius Charges to be re-rolled.</characteristic>
